WEBVTT

00:11.430 --> 00:13.030
Hello, dear sister.

00:13.600 --> 00:15.170
How are you feeling?

00:15.990 --> 00:19.920
Getting kidnapped by the maid you took 
such good care of... You poor thing.

00:21.680 --> 00:23.820
Why would you do something like this?

00:24.250 --> 00:27.390
To make my dear brother angry, of course.

00:29.310 --> 00:32.560
Up until now, my brother hasn't 
paid any attention to me.

00:32.560 --> 00:36.090
It's was only when I interacted 
with you that he looked at me.

00:36.560 --> 00:40.560
When my brother is angry, 
his emotions turn toward me.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.690
That realization gave me a sense 
of peace deep within my heart.

00:46.430 --> 00:49.230
You want to be closer to your older 
brother, don't you, Your Highness?

00:51.000 --> 00:51.730
What?

00:53.130 --> 00:54.380
This is stupid.

00:54.860 --> 00:57.260
I'm going to go play with 
my older brother now.

00:57.990 --> 01:00.150
Make sure you behave yourself.

01:10.000 --> 01:11.050
Lady Rishe!

01:11.540 --> 01:12.550
Are you all right?

01:13.200 --> 01:14.890
Please don't worry.

01:14.890 --> 01:18.460
No matter what happens, I 
promise I'll protect you.

01:18.460 --> 01:19.630
I promise!

01:19.630 --> 01:21.980
Lady Rishe, I swear I will help you.

01:23.840 --> 01:28.060
Prince Theodore has ordered you 
two to do something, hasn't he?

01:29.350 --> 01:31.440
How did you know?

01:31.910 --> 01:35.800
The letter I received from Prince 
Theodore the other day...

01:35.800 --> 01:36.950
that was you, Elsie, wasn't it?

01:38.710 --> 01:42.120
You're the only maid here 
who is from the slums.

01:42.610 --> 01:44.580
Sir Kamil, you're from there, too.

01:45.760 --> 01:51.400
And for many years, Prince Theodore has 
been privately supporting the slums.

01:53.970 --> 01:57.760
Lady Rishe, we've been 
ordered to imprison you.

01:57.760 --> 02:00.970
But we've been told to 
make sure you aren't hurt.

02:01.240 --> 02:04.530
I see. You can tell me the details later.

02:05.240 --> 02:06.880
For now, we should be on our way.

02:07.410 --> 02:08.850
On our way?

02:09.110 --> 02:10.220
Of course.

02:10.220 --> 02:14.610
I will go and be imprisoned, just 
as Prince Theodore has ordered.

02:14.610 --> 02:15.360
What?

02:31.620 --> 02:33.190
This makes me so happy!

02:33.190 --> 02:36.510
To think you'd come all the 
way here just to see me!

02:37.380 --> 02:41.120
How many years has it been since 
we've spoken this way, dear brother?

02:41.120 --> 02:43.140
Wait, this is the first time!

02:48.790 --> 02:52.400
So, if it's for her sake, 
you'll do what I say.

02:52.790 --> 02:54.770
Get to the point.

02:55.930 --> 02:58.070
What I want...

02:58.070 --> 03:00.110
is to be next in line for the throne.

03:00.800 --> 03:02.960
If you want my dear older 
sister returned to you,

03:02.960 --> 03:05.330
then renounce your claim to the throne.

03:05.750 --> 03:09.200
If you don't comply, I can't be bothered
to make sure nothing untoward befalls her.

03:09.200 --> 03:11.790
You don't want that to happen, do you?

03:13.790 --> 03:17.250
Your expression seems unconcerned, 
but you're worried, aren't you?

03:17.250 --> 03:19.410
You're absolutely beside yourself with worry.

03:19.410 --> 03:22.550
Because that's how important 
she is to you, right?

03:22.870 --> 03:24.550
You treasure her!

03:24.550 --> 03:26.620
You show interest and concern for her!

03:26.620 --> 03:29.200
You want to keep her by your side!

03:29.200 --> 03:32.280
Unlike me! You don't even 
want to see my face!

03:33.790 --> 03:35.440
I can tell that much, you know?

03:36.590 --> 03:37.480
After all...

03:38.390 --> 03:42.270
I've been watching you all this time.

03:43.900 --> 03:46.430
Come on, Brother. Say it.

03:46.870 --> 03:48.450
Say, "You win."

03:48.870 --> 03:50.990
Say, "This time, you've beaten me."

03:52.300 --> 03:54.460
If you'd just do that...

03:55.630 --> 03:56.870
my life would be complete.

04:00.270 --> 04:01.340
Theodore.

04:02.290 --> 04:04.640
You said that you'd imprisoned her,

04:04.640 --> 04:06.650
but did you put her in a prison?

04:08.190 --> 04:10.570
I put her in a room that's 
as good as a prison.

04:10.570 --> 04:12.290
And the door is locked, of course.

04:12.790 --> 04:15.270
Locked, is it? What else?

04:15.270 --> 04:18.300
There are some rough types keeping watch.

04:18.300 --> 04:20.020
The room is on an upper floor,

04:20.020 --> 04:22.080
so she won't be able to escape 
out the window.

04:22.080 --> 04:24.680
I see. So, there's a window, too.

04:25.400 --> 04:27.320
What are you trying to say?

04:27.320 --> 04:29.370
No one could possibly escape!

04:29.680 --> 04:31.370
Not normally, no.

04:31.870 --> 04:35.170
Let me warn you, if I 
give just one indication,

04:35.170 --> 04:37.750
it will be all too easy 
to hurt my dear sister.

04:38.150 --> 04:39.500
My foolish little brother.

04:41.010 --> 04:43.490
There isn't a single path 
for you to win here.

04:44.050 --> 04:47.590
Not from the moment you thought 
you had captured that girl.

04:47.590 --> 04:51.520
What? Brother, you aren't 
acting like yourself.

04:51.520 --> 04:53.640
If you have something to say, then just—

04:53.170 --> 04:53.640
Listen.

04:54.080 --> 04:54.890
Here it comes.

04:55.560 --> 04:57.100
What are you talking—

05:05.390 --> 05:06.330
This can't be real.

05:08.920 --> 05:12.790
I've come to settle things 
between us, Prince Theodore.

05:15.040 --> 05:16.720
This isn't possible.

05:17.520 --> 05:20.790
I heard you were being held in 
a room "as good as a prison."

05:21.150 --> 05:22.900
Did you leave through the window?

05:22.900 --> 05:25.420
Or, did you do something like 
punch a hole through a wall?

05:26.610 --> 05:28.800
I left through the door like a normal person!

05:29.760 --> 05:33.370
Through a locked door being 
watched by guards. That's normal?

05:33.370 --> 05:36.580
How did you do it? Has someone betrayed me?

05:36.580 --> 05:37.970
Prince Theodore.

05:39.090 --> 05:41.270
I respectfully offer you 
the following advice.

05:41.470 --> 05:42.780
Advice?

05:44.500 --> 05:46.150
First of all...

05:47.400 --> 05:48.910
when you have captured a prisoner...

05:48.910 --> 05:51.420
you must be careful never to 
take your eyes off them.

05:52.640 --> 05:55.660
Even if you lock them into 
a room by themselves,

05:55.660 --> 05:58.250
leaving them alone is 
completely out of the question.

05:58.250 --> 06:02.710
You should always leave at least 
two guards in the room with them.

06:06.360 --> 06:08.220
And second...

06:08.810 --> 06:12.600
the search of the prisoner's body should 
always be conducted by multiple people.

06:12.930 --> 06:14.980
Don't allow them to keep their clothes on.

06:14.980 --> 06:17.730
Searching them while they are 
completely nude is most effective.

06:17.730 --> 06:21.320
That way, they won't be able to 
hide weapons or tools for escape.

06:23.670 --> 06:25.330
And third...

06:25.860 --> 06:28.800
after you have shackled their 
hands behind their back,

06:28.800 --> 06:32.110
the best thing to do is to tie 
them to a pillar or a bed,

06:32.110 --> 06:34.050
but that's still too lenient.

06:34.640 --> 06:38.540
Do you know what the one thing 
you absolutely must do is?

06:40.890 --> 06:43.880
Break both their arms and both their legs.

06:45.260 --> 06:47.500
Restrain their broken limbs,

06:47.500 --> 06:50.300
take everything they have, 
and have a group guard them.

06:51.010 --> 06:55.430
That's what it means to 
take someone prisoner.

07:00.020 --> 07:03.610
Why are you instructing the 
person who took you captive?

07:03.610 --> 07:06.340
Your Highness! I'm perfectly all right!

07:06.340 --> 07:08.470
It's fine. You wear it.

07:08.470 --> 07:10.030
But, your neck will be...

07:11.110 --> 07:13.440
<i>What is that scar?</i>

07:14.130 --> 07:15.620
<i>I don't know anything about it.</i>

07:19.220 --> 07:21.760
<i>I knew it. I'm not good enough after all.</i>

07:23.750 --> 07:25.290
Prince Theodore.

07:25.930 --> 07:29.490
Please answer me. What is your aim in this?

07:30.990 --> 07:33.410
To be next in line to the throne.

07:33.410 --> 07:37.640
There's no other reason for two people in 
the line of succession to fight, is there?

07:37.640 --> 07:40.060
I don't believe that to be true.

07:40.630 --> 07:42.140
I think it's actually the opposite.

07:44.130 --> 07:50.280
Your objective is to abdicate your place 
in the line of succession, isn't it?

07:51.250 --> 07:52.490
What are you talking about?

07:52.490 --> 07:56.480
I couldn't understand 
why you would target me.

07:56.480 --> 07:59.930
I told you! It's to make my brother suffer!

07:59.930 --> 08:04.130
If he couldn't protect his fiancée, then 
his reputation would be completely destroyed!

08:04.130 --> 08:07.250
Using someone as trivial as 
me to steal the throne...

08:07.250 --> 08:09.850
You don't seriously believe 
that would work, do you?

08:11.000 --> 08:13.360
By playing out this farce of a kidnapping,

08:13.360 --> 08:17.550
you intended to create a commotion and 
disgrace yourself as a criminal, didn't you?

08:18.480 --> 08:19.460
You're wrong.

08:20.300 --> 08:22.530
There was a certain moment at which

08:22.530 --> 08:26.100
you ceased your public works 
in the slums, didn't you?

08:26.910 --> 08:29.360
I grew weary of that ludicrous charity work.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.860
That's a lie.

08:31.340 --> 08:35.660
Even very recently, you've been sending 
support to the slums, haven't you?

08:36.270 --> 08:38.660
There isn't any evidence 
of public funds being used,

08:38.660 --> 08:41.020
so you must be investing your own money.

08:42.900 --> 08:47.490
You worry more for the people 
of the slums than anyone else,

08:47.490 --> 08:49.810
and you've approached them with kindness.

08:51.010 --> 08:54.090
But you have deliberately 
neglected your public duties.

08:54.830 --> 08:58.080
I just want to beat my brother, that's all.

08:58.080 --> 09:02.160
If that were the case, then you'd 
have attacked Prince Arnold directly.

09:02.160 --> 09:03.210
You're wrong.

09:03.210 --> 09:05.390
But you couldn't do that.

09:05.390 --> 09:08.230
That's because everything you do 
is for your older brother's sake—

09:08.230 --> 09:09.230
You're wrong!

09:09.230 --> 09:11.720
You're wrong! Wrong, wrong, wrong!

09:11.720 --> 09:15.000
Honestly, what is all this 
nonsense you're spouting?

09:15.000 --> 09:19.970
I want my brother to hate me! 
To despise me! To cast me out!

09:19.970 --> 09:24.370
If he'll never accept me, then being 
killed by him would be so much better!

09:24.370 --> 09:26.370
That's enough. This stops here.

09:26.630 --> 09:28.300
Prince Arnold.

09:28.300 --> 09:29.990
I've told you, Rishe.

09:29.990 --> 09:31.940
Don't interact with him.

09:31.940 --> 09:34.970
Please, wait. Your younger 
brother's true feelings are—

09:34.970 --> 09:37.050
I don't care.

09:38.170 --> 09:40.790
Regardless of what his desires may be,

09:40.790 --> 09:42.970
they have nothing to do with me.

09:44.720 --> 09:48.060
I already knew that all too well.

09:51.130 --> 09:52.730
Prince Theodore!

09:52.730 --> 09:53.890
Leave him be.

09:55.830 --> 10:00.240
Why do you intentionally try to 
distance yourself from your brother?

10:00.460 --> 10:03.240
I told you. He doesn't matter to me.

10:03.480 --> 10:05.800
If you really felt that way,

10:05.800 --> 10:08.870
then you wouldn't order me to 
stay away from him, would you?

10:09.940 --> 10:12.630
You said something the other day.

10:12.630 --> 10:15.830
You said, "The resolve to be my 
wife? There's no need for that."

10:16.640 --> 10:20.640
I've been trying all this time to 
understand what your words meant.

10:21.770 --> 10:26.980
You are looking at the future 
which should be yours

10:26.980 --> 10:29.670
with the intention of throwing 
it all away, aren't you?

10:31.600 --> 10:35.270
That's what your younger brother 
is afraid of, isn't he?

10:35.730 --> 10:40.080
That's why he puts on an act of being the 
second prince with no aspirations to the throne,

10:40.080 --> 10:43.280
of being someone who should disappear 
from the future of this empire.

10:43.960 --> 10:48.760
But isn't there some other 
path for you two brothers?

10:50.480 --> 10:52.940
Please tell me what you're thinking.

11:05.150 --> 11:07.180
Oh, I see.

11:11.840 --> 11:15.650
And now, I've finally confirmed it.

11:21.040 --> 11:23.870
You're quite adorable.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.290
What are you...

11:25.290 --> 11:27.890
You can't understand my intentions,

11:27.890 --> 11:29.560
so you feel confused, right?

11:30.250 --> 11:32.360
But it's better that you don't understand.

11:33.620 --> 11:37.760
I will say it again, leave Theodore alone.

11:43.600 --> 11:47.470
He should never have gotten 
involved with someone like me.

11:50.700 --> 11:53.210
You do adore your brother, don't you?

11:53.690 --> 11:54.800
What?

11:54.800 --> 11:56.710
If you didn't treasure him,

11:56.710 --> 11:59.150
you would never have said 
something like that.

11:59.390 --> 12:04.740
Your Highness, have you ever considered a 
future opposite to one where you disappear?

12:05.500 --> 12:06.820
Opposite?

12:07.490 --> 12:09.710
One where your brother disappears.

12:09.710 --> 12:12.250
There may be a future like that, too.

12:12.250 --> 12:16.030
Please live your life in a way that you 
have no regrets if that does come to pass.

12:17.150 --> 12:20.760
<i>And if I had my wish, I'd do the same.</i>

12:21.050 --> 12:24.380
<i>So that even if this life is my last...</i>

12:27.710 --> 12:34.020
And I intend to live my life 
as your wife with no regrets.

12:42.090 --> 12:42.930
Damn it.

12:49.400 --> 12:51.710
This is just about all I have left in me.

12:52.490 --> 12:53.380
But...

13:01.030 --> 13:04.440
<i>I can still remember what 
happened on the battlefield.</i>

13:05.010 --> 13:08.350
Hang in there! The medicine 
will be here soon!

13:08.350 --> 13:10.750
Thank you.

13:11.600 --> 13:12.770
We're being attacked!

13:21.620 --> 13:24.690
<i>There wasn't anything that someone 
as useless as me could do.</i>

13:24.690 --> 13:26.580
<i>I knew that, but I still...</i>

13:37.290 --> 13:38.420
Brother?

13:42.400 --> 13:45.200
As a member of the imperial family, 
I can't praise your actions.

13:46.620 --> 13:49.420
Next time, don't do anything 
that puts your life at risk.

13:50.720 --> 13:54.270
But the fact that you acted 
to protect your vassal...

13:54.270 --> 13:56.130
That's something to be proud of.

13:58.010 --> 13:59.050
Well done.

14:07.260 --> 14:08.730
Prince Theodore.

14:10.980 --> 14:15.000
Are you planning to follow your lecture 
on imprisonment with one on escaping?

14:15.280 --> 14:17.750
You weren't planning on 
escaping, though, were you?

14:20.230 --> 14:24.510
My brother, you see, never shows his 
achievements to the outside world.

14:25.080 --> 14:29.260
On the other hand, his infamy spreads 
to other countries unnaturally quickly.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.640
Why do you think that is?

14:31.370 --> 14:35.770
Prince Arnold is intentionally 
spreading it himself, isn't he?

14:36.170 --> 14:38.790
I know because I've been 
watching him all this time.

14:38.790 --> 14:43.250
I see him and think, "He's acting in a way 
that will let him disappear at any moment."

14:44.360 --> 14:48.130
But for a person as wonderful 
as him to disappear...

14:49.040 --> 14:50.600
that just isn't right.

14:53.170 --> 14:56.350
If he intends to entrust the 
empire to me and disappear,

14:56.350 --> 14:58.290
then I just need to disappear first.

14:59.050 --> 15:02.920
If I do, then my brother won't be 
able to do anything stupid anymore.

15:03.230 --> 15:08.530
It's the one and only way that 
I can be useful to my brother.

15:10.960 --> 15:16.320
I'm certain that your older brother intends 
to do something utterly unreasonable.

15:17.160 --> 15:19.810
Which is why I plan to use 
everything I have to stop him.

15:20.360 --> 15:23.020
If there are others whose strengths 
I can call on, I will do so.

15:23.020 --> 15:25.320
And, Prince Theodore...

15:25.660 --> 15:28.060
I need your strength, too.

15:31.100 --> 15:34.200
Someone like me will never 
be a strength for you.

15:34.200 --> 15:37.380
No, that's not true.

15:37.380 --> 15:38.170
After all...

15:38.910 --> 15:43.060
you are the only little brother he 
has in this whole world, aren't you?

15:57.800 --> 16:01.720
I wanted to help my brother one day.

16:03.610 --> 16:05.030
Thank you, Sister.

16:05.890 --> 16:10.310
For you to tell me you need me is 
unexpected, but it makes me happy.

16:11.280 --> 16:15.780
But I will decide how I will best be used.

16:18.740 --> 16:22.290
I should have done this a long time ago.

16:23.030 --> 16:23.870
<i>He couldn't possibly!</i>

16:24.090 --> 16:27.130
This was all such a huge failure, wasn't it?

16:27.130 --> 16:28.340
Your Highness!

16:58.760 --> 16:59.900
Brother?

17:19.560 --> 17:22.390
What were you thinking?

17:23.290 --> 17:24.190
But...

17:24.810 --> 17:30.870
But... this is the only way 
I can be useful to you.

17:31.520 --> 17:36.170
I have never once done anything 
to be a big brother to you.

17:36.170 --> 17:38.660
What kind of idiot risks his 
life for someone like that?

17:43.630 --> 17:47.900
The choice your little brother made 
may not have been the right one,

17:48.420 --> 17:54.860
but his desire to become a strength 
for you isn't wrong, is it?

17:56.550 --> 17:59.180
It's just as she says.

17:59.670 --> 18:01.900
I'll wish this over and over again.

18:02.680 --> 18:04.910
I want to be a strength to you!

18:04.910 --> 18:06.570
I want to be useful to you!

18:06.570 --> 18:08.670
If I can be of help to you, 
then I'll do anything!

18:09.200 --> 18:14.310
Because you're my only big 
brother in the whole world,

18:14.310 --> 18:16.220
and I look up to you so much!

18:21.820 --> 18:25.580
Never do anything this foolish ever again.

18:28.080 --> 18:29.460
I told you.

18:31.370 --> 18:34.840
Don't ever put your life at risk again.

18:39.060 --> 18:40.190
You remember?

18:40.900 --> 18:42.050
Of course I do.

18:47.870 --> 18:49.630
I'm sorry!

18:50.060 --> 18:52.480
I'm sorry, Big Brother!

18:52.480 --> 18:54.680
I'm sorry, Big Sister!

18:54.680 --> 18:55.860
I'm sorry...

18:56.730 --> 18:58.340
I understand, so stop crying.

18:58.920 --> 19:00.080
But, this is just...

19:08.400 --> 19:09.430
Rishe.

19:09.430 --> 19:11.500
You came for him, didn't you?

19:12.040 --> 19:14.220
Because you said something that bothered me.

19:15.090 --> 19:18.510
I'm glad you two were able to mend things.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.980
I'm so glad...

19:21.440 --> 19:22.220
Rishe?

19:24.070 --> 19:27.200
Sister! What do I do? This is all my fault!

19:27.200 --> 19:28.270
No, it isn't.

19:28.270 --> 19:28.770
What?

19:30.540 --> 19:32.060
She's just sleeping.

19:33.160 --> 19:35.710
You can't be serious. In these circumstances?

19:43.520 --> 19:46.320
Theodore, you have a carriage 
at the ready, don't you?

19:47.040 --> 19:48.970
O-Of course I do.

19:48.970 --> 19:50.290
I'll call for it right away.

19:50.590 --> 19:51.570
I'll leave it to you.

20:00.720 --> 20:02.430
"I'll leave it to you," he said.

20:03.090 --> 20:06.160
My big brother. To me.

20:27.800 --> 20:29.580
You're already awake?

20:29.580 --> 20:32.240
Have you stayed with me all this time?

20:32.240 --> 20:34.080
I'm so very sorry!

20:34.610 --> 20:35.760
How are you?

20:35.760 --> 20:37.370
I'm fine now.

20:37.840 --> 20:38.710
Good.

20:44.020 --> 20:45.180
<i>To my sister,</i>

20:45.690 --> 20:48.580
<i>I'm sorry for doing all 
those awful things to you.</i>

20:48.580 --> 20:53.850
<i>There are many things I want to say, but 
firstly, I promise to repay the debt I owe you.</i>

20:54.800 --> 20:59.040
<i>And you said you'd stop whatever it is that 
my brother is trying to do, didn't you?</i>

20:59.560 --> 21:03.150
<i>Given the way things are now, 
I'd like to help you with that.</i>

21:04.060 --> 21:07.240
<i>To that end, I'll let you 
borrow my people in the slums.</i>

21:07.510 --> 21:09.860
<i>That's what people refer to 
as a common front, right?</i>

21:09.860 --> 21:11.920
<i>Come to me for help any time.</i>

21:11.920 --> 21:14.000
<i>With due gratitude to me, of course.</i>

21:15.480 --> 21:16.500
<i>Lastly...</i>

21:17.230 --> 21:19.330
<i>thank you, Big Sister.</i>

21:20.250 --> 21:23.640
You and Prince Theodore 
had a talk, didn't you?

21:24.110 --> 21:26.910
Why are you smiling like that?

21:26.910 --> 21:29.010
Because I'm happy, of course.

21:33.120 --> 21:36.040
Think of something else you want.

21:37.570 --> 21:40.100
My promise not to touch you.

21:40.100 --> 21:42.400
